{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4246d48205b4aa8745c5feb48fb335b7fc14c430a56944412377b374ef336f64",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:775bfb39ff5a0441f26c8519f80ab532fd3849c7f227b2ef2810d94c13ae42e0",
      "text": "闪耀的小小光芒们",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128d375c978e614cbcb15bb6d5e7f7e5e281b69e9e41812b05fd89abf1081781",
      "text": "花音身穿父亲品牌的服装，努力做着模特工作。\n然而他得知随着成长，自己将无法再穿父亲制作的衣服，大受打击。\n面对陷入悲伤的花音，父亲告诉他有偶像邀请找上门来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:775bfb39ff5a0441f26c8519f80ab532fd3849c7f227b2ef2810d94c13ae42e0",
      "text": "闪耀的小小光芒们",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c367219503dbe9af89deacd2774e635f04bc2f5b731e5f1c1296a352949693d3",
      "text": "花音君，请看这边！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d71ac305c4e9487027314263374bf5f4dc549f9ad0c2fe230e10af592cc72e4c",
      "text": "好～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b628c04c0bd72840accb213ff4d0469bb4297c603b294d680ecfdc503d7ded6",
      "text": "（这件衣服的内衬很可爱，所以……这样！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a510c07fe346a7260b4c982bc40a1cc70f99f5ce3bea6253822a3e27f7c2f00",
      "text": "摄影师，能让我看一下刚才的照片吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b17fb2b4643b3a49e0c2a0f9c7429e0367cb60dc539cbbf8796390508b8c5c5",
      "text": "唔～……右脚再稍微抬高一点\n会不会更好呢……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6598ae3de3cc5fa09c65c77d78061933ad2e96e1016262f72424f5399ba52c56",
      "text": "各位工作人员，这件衣服的拍摄，\n可以让我再试一次吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac808e5af6f5b576e630efff6d2ae94aaa7edb29c929425783d612b108ff4dea",
      "text": "好，花音君OK了！\n那我们换下一个小朋友吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_a:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f3f7a51a0b438a197652844c30b0407f4e22cf2d999a18b846606b07b62c866",
      "text": "呐呐。刚才的姿势，像这样\n把手稍微放低一点怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_a:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3984fff9730ca2fc55b22401f6eb7ddf457746fd1f2f47c86d8b24dbe520523f",
      "text": "还有，从这个角度看裙子的形状会\n更漂亮，看起来更可爱哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_a:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70bf67970b6408723824b68aa5875321b8bd086a90b33b59d986fd7ffa1526db",
      "text": "我试试！\n谢谢你，花音君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_a:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52d832d1acb6144190d54b864fadabc04ff9e1fcb8b68040e9649a56eee170d8",
      "text": "花音君真厉害啊！除了自己的拍摄，\n居然还会给其他孩子提出建议。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_a:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55a608d15503dc3b21aea0585ec02ae10ba95eeb9922e33669e22e04d563a78c",
      "text": "是啊。年纪还这么小，专业意识就\n这么高……！连大人都自愧不如啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:040029224725c9fb2486060620b698fbf4f784cdcb9fa7a6bd965aaa684f9221",
      "text": "嗯，今天的照片也很完美♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8021d143668d45bd1fba484d9a0c769613b97c651a2b089dc37fc65fccfad764",
      "text": "拍到了让可爱的衣服\n看起来更～可爱的照片呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6032f3c23b8fa844b8ffa21a5d28c934948091b4ccb266998177a170de02f5c3",
      "text": "辛苦了，花音。今天也很完美哦。\n拍了这么长时间，累不累？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acf04beadc7ca47c28cef42aca22ba7a9f94154a1211059cc8a398c909e4e482",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿，谢谢爸爸～♪一点都不累哦。\n花音想把爸爸漂亮的衣服展现得更可爱嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a9d137928f4643631bbb9513822f15125e2a17b83350d5eb9d801d6461f9a7a",
      "text": "而且呢，\n能穿毛茸茸的衣服，花音好幸福♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb2fafb6b2fcf06dfaee6fd554b4b275e6cfe6f84acc79aeda86169893043455",
      "text": "以后我也要一直穿爸爸做的\n可爱衣服～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_b:cmd-000081:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:048557fc73d2b59665f41fa4f9e374ab0f11d3e4550bdf65340a568d03f9cd2a",
      "text": "一周后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_b:cmd-000094:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f97feea80f7f1030f6d4b71e996d81325598426326e9f0ace7078446355afb5",
      "text": "姬野家·客厅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_b:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92b08fd9919d992dd800a2803af8e8bd21b33b34733cfb4e1881a82f6ac92dc0",
      "text": "爸爸～？啊，找到你了。\n咦？那个是下一期新作的草图吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_b:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca8b15dc549b0b8f48d9257018b3b783a8f9a67b37e2b734f1e4f0f0c0f7b13f",
      "text": "领子的形状超级可爱。\n诶嘿嘿，好期待穿上它呀♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_b:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12db32513bf887107949bed1c8e97b505ab50c52d1d6b1d8c298d5a18e9fc895",
      "text": "对、对不起啊，花音……\n这个我打算请别的小朋友来当模特。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_b:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:096b130ddc4124f916d62097e39137d49652a648fdb9d06cd7f8a57597022957",
      "text": "哎——！为什么？\n花音不能穿这件衣服吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c61d9566c9cfd635cc5a81b6068f536c8c44e0fe6b7fe18c1a8e5667cb364451",
      "text": "这次新作的衣服，\n对花音来说已经太小了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:083f110266ea9f4770b8816bb4140e7841961adb3d6c3efbd2b219830d01f848",
      "text": "怎、怎么会这样～……\n花音明明最喜欢爸爸的衣服了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52aeb30435527ccc176a00b68fd0d0b67659c55e2ac3192ea97ca93a5e0332e5",
      "text": "明明……明明……呜哇啊啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d7df980f8d5e0e82694bb48373c67297a2a4c7df1da4a5c45c4dfedb76534d8",
      "text": "花音！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:970eb1b90d96df3d617903c2aac1319e9fbcaae7eb7cb7714338240831998fb6",
      "text": "呜呜～～嗝……抽泣……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d28ef1695113effd0d83d8169f07e3be81adc7cb6488bfe2e076fdc3b3c1edd",
      "text": "花音，爸爸进来了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50232abd2a841f39f301c161d6b60cfd7d39eb54dd0ff96a8f3630dbe1b7f7dc",
      "text": "爸爸……嗝……呐，再也穿不了爸爸做的衣服\n什么的，是骗人的对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_c:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cd913292ad0ada59435a3a89cd494d275b10da51aad2c71cf18714053223112",
      "text": "花音能喜欢爸爸的衣服，爸爸很高兴哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_c:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecd276fa298771419029996dca7163f1701007bf1fe51a29a20b47a32dc74eb2",
      "text": "但是啊，人会长大成人的。\n总有一天会迎来这一刻的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_c:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a24a47fd65bcdd4d2c9e5ee9c67db3555369217dd78208ebf7cf57ac84056b6c",
      "text": "呜呜……怎么会这样……\n那花音才不要长大呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:907d9deab2ebe7fed22b34ab40a6b52dc718ff69be414e247fc44a0ca16346c1",
      "text": "花音……对了。偶像事务所的\n制作人，给花音发来联络了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3818efb0e2c1c7b672feed839aef3dd48374dbbefe618ab35b2865814e1efe41",
      "text": "偶像……？\n嗝，为什么找花音？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a2f52698df4da1d7863cf59af46f3f78ce063e1c3728c84287bdd555a4b83de",
      "text": "说是看到了花音当模特的表现。非常热心地\n希望你能参加试镜呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f845377c93b48e2935719446fee64acb28c42d13814a9aea904025a2bae0f3b2",
      "text": "要是不介意的话，哪怕只是去听听看呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ccca2e355da52842bc13537045e37e1ac075d4a33be0417dceef21a8ce532e0",
      "text": "（……虽然花音不太懂偶像是什么，\n但有人很看重花音呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8ee7cefc219e02612530d59112ea2850e2423167631a8ba5096c7ad0f2f3bd9",
      "text": "嗯……我知道了。\n花音去听听看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_d:cmd-000059:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f199b2bf828378b9f2601606db7b29caf92f9ab5146929784da92ea775d2f12",
      "text": "好啦，到了。\n这里就是315 Production了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_d:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afc8ea9e36014c69a396472c83a97eeed6314b9bb34fdfe2b1067e4c5cfd5990",
      "text": "这里就是偶像的事务所吗……？\n呜呜，破破烂烂又阴暗，一点也不可爱～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1325c2ad47b1db593d7fb21fc9f7e9428a12eb951ebf709ad90fe2243b8e7a5c",
      "text": "喂，不能这么说话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_d:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea901ae5e360610f0cad698b650ad52de4b77e69ae8c339b32922b7aae1541fb",
      "text": "我是今天预约过的姬野。\n请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_d:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:747fd7d8a6a7594922874666bb95c8685242312d779a940bfdf1035b2d47fe09",
      "text": "您好。\n非常感谢二位的光临！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_d:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de0769863fa370c67c4e10566be6453482a2a66422af8c660127be0bccaa59a3",
      "text": "今天请多多关照。\n那么，请往这边走。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_d:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f45d7ffa6c147b3598ad14b10a7e34ad20a6bdfb0139c448e065cc8112c13fd1",
      "text": "请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_e:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3305ecc8390b37964f7cf6afd926cb0eeab4ec60f432729a0d3e44302b9477",
      "text": "那么开门见山……花音君，对偶像有\n兴趣吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_e:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a19b987e2ced2c43766d1a7cccf7ecfa3fcd2d61290395ba02ef97c64b9efd02",
      "text": "偶像，是那个偶像吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b8178b81f294849642ab235b79ca5a4e094820733bf6d5b5a0b7afc0183a8cb",
      "text": "是的。就是边唱边跳的那个偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e59ca365e3280595d4bff8b48b348b6e8947958798ea80bad1f42786316c606c",
      "text": "花音穿衣服、摆姿势虽然很拿手，\n但可没办法动那么多哦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91b1db2145eb3aea8634f45a47dc728bda19f2b5e9a920355c498e676ee7f7b4",
      "text": "为什么会觉得花音能当偶像呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e58bf7214fb7f922ec14a6962755e44af713973b8d2bd79bc5de0f40d89589b",
      "text": "之前花音君出演的特别节目，\n我在现场旁听过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4103bb1ce1fea26e6d7491e22ae9e5472911e6b38467eaca03a743a5958133f7",
      "text": "深知什么是“可爱”，并能完美表达出来的\n花音君，真的非常耀眼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:239b778ef2d6e9b246e2eb3bdb62e98b4b1583bbe4ed246f1d24fdb9181a7114",
      "text": "我觉得花音君在舞台上也一定能\n抓住很多人的心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:116f2c4e1e03e4bcb497b765da82e66d159a9a8cf4c517f6631753e3c1349adf",
      "text": "哇，是这样啊……\n谢谢您♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cc5d545823d54ed61afd37ac1274fda6f0cd8c702e22b4be95bada3990fc7ea",
      "text": "另外，花音君作为模特的工作表现，\n以及极高的专业素养也非常出色……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d32bc7c63ddd0ae1d895001635ab0bec4b9f474766280988a8d3b6fea5936e5",
      "text": "业界甚至传闻，你对待工作的态度\n在同龄人中可以说是拔尖的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba98996d030a117b50ad5e5b804166093a5869cd62369b1647876b2275973096",
      "text": "噢……！您居然对花音有\n这么高的评价吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47e413c09051226f54fa17bcbe890f70a734435acc1f407a403ba3c2555447fd",
      "text": "是的，确实如此！前几天也是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e13c8333c1aef4e301c9f820cbf03cff208ff7133dd112cdadc26cc0a4f0b8f",
      "text": "（制作人，把花音的工作\n夸得好厉害！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e34291cbdaff930f293570ac165f190ca75a3dd479cb1f0eab9f021ec67b6c2",
      "text": "（但是，要是花音长大了呢？\n也许就不会再夸花音了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c29bf87a43814887a418c5d1216207c994efe419f438f622bd8972ca568f4b1",
      "text": "……所以，如果你有一点兴趣的话，\n请务必来参加试镜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5bb17d955d2d2b243232c22845cce101d4f7a08b74816cfd15d856e78398339",
      "text": "……可是花音长大了之后，\n就穿不了可爱的衣服了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cea2621ca95f5ba9bb86f5fcacdbc6fed17f0c2cefd13630af2449b7f7e50b4",
      "text": "没有那种事。\n如果是花音君的话，什么样的演出服都能驾驭的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eea0b83011703c045ec42f792c94ef0862a50d48f70fd24288274f647be18005",
      "text": "演出服？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9974dd2b823d85a7b17a8b5db64117c9e2522b49906a7ead8414012a67fad67a",
      "text": "（啊，对哦！偶像是会在电视节目什么的里面\n穿各种各样可爱的衣服的！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_f:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8583bc95d89005f6004aa7dffb5d72ef4ef0a1247b448fe44a2521b4e22c248b",
      "text": "（闪闪发光又毛茸茸的可爱演出服……\n花音也想穿穿看呀……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_g:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ffd521aa0a7fad28f63a7b4e3dae9292de8c09e4d6b9615dd98289b90d03b9e",
      "text": "花音当了偶像的话，\n就能穿可爱的演出服了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_g:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:154611d2f62dda7edf2735194a4bcc35c82a5c1d9290f2e5cc0502222ed90cd3",
      "text": "那当然了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_g:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:848cf6219576cad34cfda840a2c41f21221576083d83b89c02903c785a8babb3",
      "text": "就算花音长大了也是吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_g:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68d07d7483138654f6d941dcb3a65b31a823ac2241ddb0b6d04fc14a7c2df7cc",
      "text": "……？是的，只要花音君希望的话！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_g:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8892a7af26da7cc17d73fdff81ef220108581c10875393f405ba9da7a9f9ddd",
      "text": "这样啊……能穿啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_g:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:299d1a28add7dd1afdf34b0e9cb7ccd871973b524f0726f74c3ef17f86ae1c94",
      "text": "（……虽然总有一天会穿不下爸爸做的衣服，\n但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_g:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70486f85dd9e3d19e48832a3f95ed4c33eb3590ecb75e6fd48bb1d9faa7531d3",
      "text": "（当了偶像的话，就能一～直穿可爱的\n衣服了呀！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_g:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49b56b64b5874517f37a69435830c601e2485567ee7333e17c6aefbea9df76c5",
      "text": "距离试镜还有一段时间，\n答复可以慢慢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_g:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d52437654da9369b9094f8927cc707d6b3d78ee1589ecb21e57370df7e9e40e",
      "text": "花音想当偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_g:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4319b9675149f84fafc241f791db9d2c8846d6608956af443d5b55e7fbe34b2",
      "text": "我会参加偶像的试镜的。\n拜托您了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_h:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbcd845c605acd725b07001d7a70fbcabaeeb81e9ac86cc8fbb313e1e36745d8",
      "text": "不再多考虑一下真的没关系吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_h:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a55bb1be11210972e03ddf49ccce3628f2d16ecd7504e8d4afb3d7c2c51e4aa",
      "text": "嗯。花音要当偶像♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8ad4c086275cdbd0747f3c9973ece0ed787aa06ee7b702cb246648860dd9735",
      "text": "既然花音都这么说了……\n能请您详细说明一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_h:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6aecfaf369708c7cad7ecf6db9fd2753feabcedfad00018ff0d0eba19bbfc01e",
      "text": "好的，当然没问题！\n那我这就去准备资料。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_h:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22063d920c999d61e7dbb7200315bd806fec16ff49e649670976fadf8701de77",
      "text": "贤君，能麻烦你把试镜的资料\n拿过来一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_h:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6f4d549769d9af84714a180183a168e3e919b584cd8930214733c9883636211",
      "text": "好的，请稍等片刻！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_h:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8db18d90bd0c623cd34ab686200de651b91b1e414fe78d64f5ceeeed62d9d966",
      "text": "呐呐，参加试镜的孩子里，\n有和花音年纪差不多大的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_h:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc5593e42648e175c9f3834251f52a0f9a2bff18f27480d9ba9e1e2a57c200c5",
      "text": "有的哦。\n橘志狼君和冈村直央君也会参加。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_h:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4f18626ba320b1f5fa6cf4061d035b251dff4f733752bcd35a19e15476ddd9f",
      "text": "花音认识他们两个人哦！\n原来是这样啊～……呵呵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_h:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2eeb583a74a6538556623f91877c33abf06f4d88f4d83b7fb01e9a37801fb23c",
      "text": "为了不输给他们两个，在试镜之前\n必须好好练习跳舞和唱歌才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_h:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bc2c9be4a292867b50c30237504670a27d42eb9d604df63d048773776857ea2",
      "text": "花音会加油的♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_i:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07040148948158ee20d24c7db4ef47855c677f0883c4b54eb1257d81ef39b206",
      "text": "试镜当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_i:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d56a319d18dab6cda7cdfc214c74c587c0749e8677ac64aea2c9e9551fe32f1d",
      "text": "好险——安全上垒！\n哈啊，虽然卡着点但总算赶上啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_i:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc9ff8e1f57a0fe6400a32e6b82886d6352ba05c6da653bce23b3d858e734389",
      "text": "啊，是志狼君。\n辛苦啦～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_i:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd2a253d4a5b8122e8a897339611327d854346656f4144c04bf255f5123247a9",
      "text": "志、志狼君？你怎么会……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_i:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cab0cc493d7b3064534a6f6bab1b2c83233573af277856b136de4475111d966",
      "text": "还能怎么会……我也要参加试镜啊！\n我绝对不会输给直央的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_i:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0016683cd7ef8234b7b4f617f331bd3ae7d55c33cde002611bd6566e3e134f11",
      "text": "原、原来是这样啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_i:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6316c883a17908c08e34305daffdf9149dc92e40ba515d37cda780dc082328df",
      "text": "啊——！志狼君。\n不准欺负直央君哦！不可以！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_i:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97ed8a4002fe859a45c43b0271469fd1fa8c2cc7a9682dd30c6a42acea70c991",
      "text": "哈？\n我、我又没欺负他……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_i:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a00f98c41768cb5ee158d3a4aca34598ce5b6cf2f28c3cba8fc999208051ffe",
      "text": "（吓、吓我一跳……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_i:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f6d7565d0ead1fdb8d864f9b58e2d3e19bc7872f1d09be7c460d80747fc7ad2",
      "text": "（花音长得跟女孩子似的，\n一靠近他我就浑身不自在啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:883cedad33f6f40f738d6676b441445cef306a99a330190e4acaacd0092004b9",
      "text": "花音也超级努力地练习过了哦！\n大家一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_j:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9742640acdcea03455e647dc23166c357b1406b80a8df589f66191d7647286f2",
      "text": "嗯。\n花音君你们肯定能合格的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_j:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13848c12a99d75183783250054fb07b84d63103361fc01c91845dee035ccb164",
      "text": "我虽然也练习过了，但能不能做好呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_j:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c823c2765a77d38b280896c24d031cf720ab948fb09eed2ae0514db0b2eefff",
      "text": "啊——真是的。\n你别畏畏缩缩的！给我打起精神来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_011mof_03_1_1_011_03:1_1_011_03_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10e17465950c4d222e428ac02ec824276a690f2b3ec1f69bf63dfb0b11e3f94e",
      "text": "真是的，志狼君不要生气啦。",
